plaintext
* Netlist for the schematic

* Current source
I1 1 2 DC I_Q

* First NMOS transistor
M1 2 1 3 3 NMOS

* Second NMOS transistor
M2 2 3 4 4 NMOS

* Load resistance
R1 2 5 R_0

* Voltage sources for Bias
Vbias1 1 0 DC V_Bias1
Vbias2 3 0 DC V_Bias2
Vin 4 0 DC V_i

* Ground reference
Vgnd 5 0 0

* Models
.model NMOS NMOS